  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nYour basic attack prompts this
    ally to fire one bolt for 65% of its own weapon damage. 0.7s cooldown per responding
    ally. Secondary attacks cannot trigger another response.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam
    / Flat ranged damage: +1\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4;
    merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nThey
    arose from a community's promise to keep a missing reader's place, then learned
    to read the unfinished book themselves. They seek that reader while building
    a life that does not end at the last reserved page.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nOwn
    weapon damage gains 0.5% per companion body in the roster, before later balance
    modifiers.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated
    percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed
    support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: archive, hat, rune. Immortal.
    Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless
    the talent forbids it."
